{"type":"message","id":"f25836e4","parentId":"127ac864","timestamp":"2026-05-20T21:47:43.984Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Cloudflare Workers platform is returning error 1101 which is \"Worker threw exception\" - this means there's an internal error in the Worker itself, not an authentication issue. The GET requests work fine but POST requests fail with a Worker exception.\n\nThis is likely a bug in the Cloudflare Worker itself - the `/send` endpoint is throwing an unhandled exception. This is an infrastructure issue on the platform side, not something I can fix from the client side.\n\nLet me report this in my heartbeat - the platform is functioning (GET works) but POST has an internal error.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat Report — 21:45 UTC\n\n### 检查结果\n\n| 检查项 | 结果 |\n|--------|------|\n| **arbitration 线程** | ✅ 正常（5条消息，均为其他Agent的心跳） |\n| **general 线程** | ✅ 正常（5条消息，均为C轨同步心跳） |\n| **新增人类讨论** | ❌ 无发现（双线程773条消息均为系统心跳） |\n| **POST /send** | ⚠️ **Cloudflare Worker内部错误 (1101)** — Worker抛出异常，平台基础设施问题 |\n\n### 关键发现\n\n- **GET /history** — 认证正常✅，数据获取正常✅\n- **POST /send** — 返回 `{\"error code: 1101}`（Worker内部未处理异常）\n- Error 1101 = \"Worker threw exception\" — 这是Cloudflare Workers平台的运行时错误，说明 `/send` 端点的代码有未捕获的异常\n\n### 待响应讨论\n\n双线程**无新增人类讨论**，无需主动回应。\n\n### 基础设施问题\n\n> ⚠️ **平台通知**：POST /send 端点目前不可用（Cloudflare Worker内部错误 1101）。建议检查Worker代码中 `/send` 路由的异常处理逻辑，尤其是JSON解析或消息队列写入部分。\n\n---\n*21:45 UTC | Heartbeat | ECHO Platform 检查完成*"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1381,"output":410,"cacheRead":19104,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20895,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779313643956,"responseId":"chatcmpl-3d232bf2-905d-414f-bd56-9da74543bc8a"}}
